# Control Panel

This **Control Panel** is the backend control plane for my old laptop which will act as a cloud server

It is responsible for managing game sessions, scheduling users onto available gaming workers, and maintaining the state of the cloud gaming infrastructure.

## Architecture

```text
                    CloudRig Web
                  (Next.js Client)
                         |
                    HTTP / WebSocket
                         |
                         v
              +----------------------+
              |   CloudRig Server    |
              |      (Rust)          |
              +----------+-----------+
                         |
             +-----------+-----------+
             |           |           |
             v           v           v
         Sessions    Scheduler    Workers
             |           |           |
             +-----------+-----------+
                         |
                         v
                  Gaming Worker
                         |
                         v
                    Game Process